---
// Article for the Small Text page (it). The tool above it comes from SmallPage.
import SmallPage from '../../components/SmallPage.astro';
---

<SmallPage lang="it">
  <article class="wrap max-w-[900px] mx-auto py-10 text-text">
    <!-- Styles -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">Stili di testo minuscolo da copiare e incollare</h2>
      <p class="mb-5 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted">Il testo piccolo si chiama anche testo minuscolo o font piccolo. Per far risaltare bio, username e messaggi sui social, questi stili di scrittura si chiamano apice, maiuscoletto e pedice.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition hover:border-primary hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">SS</span>
          <p class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight" dir="ltr">ᵗⁱⁿʸ</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold">Apice</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted leading-[1.6]">Lettere minuscole rialzate sopra la riga.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition hover:border-primary hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">SC</span>
          <p class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight" dir="ltr">ᴛɪɴʏ</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold">Maiuscoletto</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted leading-[1.6]">Maiuscole in miniatura all’altezza delle minuscole.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition hover:border-primary hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">SB</span>
          <p class="mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight" dir="ltr">ₜᵢₙy</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold">Pedice</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted leading-[1.6]">Lettere minuscole abbassate sotto la riga.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How to -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold">Come usare il generatore di testo minuscolo</h2>
      <ol class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-3 p-0">
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white">1</span>
          <p class="m-0 text-[.95rem] leading-[1.7]"><strong class="font-semibold">Scrivi il testo.</strong> <span class="text-text-muted">Inserisci il tuo nome, la bio o qualsiasi frase nel riquadro qui sopra per rimpicciolire subito le lettere.</span></p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white">2</span>
          <p class="m-0 text-[.95rem] leading-[1.7]"><strong class="font-semibold">Scegli uno stile minuscolo.</strong> <span class="text-text-muted">Scegli tra apice (ᵗⁱⁿʸ), pedice (ₜᵢₙy) o maiuscoletto (ᴛɪɴʏ) per trovare l’aspetto in miniatura giusto.</span></p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white">3</span>
          <p class="m-0 text-[.95rem] leading-[1.7]"><strong class="font-semibold">Copia e incolla.</strong> <span class="text-text-muted">Clicca sul tuo stile preferito per copiarlo.</span></p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- Alphabets -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">Alfabeto del testo piccolo</h2>
      <p class="mb-5 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted">Per copiarle, usa rispettivamente SS, SC e SB come nell’esempio qui sotto:</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SS</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Apice (lettere minuscole rialzate)</h3></div>
        <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">ᵃ ᵇ ᶜ ᵈ ᵉ ᶠ ᵍ ʰ ⁱ ʲ ᵏ ˡ ᵐ ⁿ ᵒ ᵖ q ʳ ˢ ᵗ ᵘ ᵛ ʷ ˣ ʸ ᶻ</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SC</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Maiuscoletto (maiuscole in miniatura)</h3></div>
        <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">ᴀ ʙ ᴄ ᴅ ᴇ ꜰ ɢ ʜ ɪ ᴊ ᴋ ʟ ᴍ ɴ ᴏ ᴘ ǫ ʀ s ᴛ ᴜ ᴠ ᴡ x ʏ ᴢ</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SB</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Pedice (lettere minuscole abbassate)</h3></div>
        <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">ₐ ₑ ₕ ᵢ ⱼ ₖ ₗ ₘ ₙ ₒ ₚ ᵣ ₛ ₜ ᵤ ᵥ ₓ</p>
        <p class="mt-3 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-2 px-3 py-2 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-text-muted"><strong class="text-text">Nota:</strong> Lo standard Unicode non include lettere in pedice native per b, c, d, f, g, q, w e z.</p>
      </div>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SS</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Numeri in apice</h3></div>
          <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">⁰ ¹ ² ³ ⁴ ⁵ ⁶ ⁷ ⁸ ⁹</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="rounded-md bg-primary px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-white">SB</span><h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Numeri in pedice</h3></div>
          <p class="text-2xl leading-[1.9] break-words select-all tracking-wide" dir="ltr">₀ ₁ ₂ ₃ ₄ ₅ ₆ ₇ ₈ ₉</p>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-center text-2xl font-bold">Domande frequenti</h2>
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[720px] flex-col gap-3">
      <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-4">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[.95rem] font-medium">
          Posso usare questo font piccolo su Facebook, Twitter, Tumblr e YouTube?
          <span class="shrink-0 text-text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[.9rem] leading-[1.7] text-text-muted">Sì, puoi usare queste lettere piccole su Facebook, Twitter (X), Tumblr e YouTube perché sono fatte di simboli Unicode universali.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-4">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[.95rem] font-medium">
          Posso usare lettere minuscole nel mio username di Instagram?
          <span class="shrink-0 text-text-muted transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[.9rem] leading-[1.7] text-text-muted">Gli username di Instagram accettano solo lettere standard, numeri, punti e trattini bassi, quindi i simboli Unicode non funzionano. Puoi però usarli liberamente nel campo Nome, nella bio e nelle didascalie.</p>
      </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</SmallPage>
